#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""ub — one disciplined agent per task, checked by Robert C. Martin's tools (ub-kit).

Run from the repository; the justfile wraps every command:
  gate [BASE]               the task's gate for what changed since BASE (default: the merge-base
                            with the main branch): verify, CRAP, DRY, mutation, structure.
                            Exit 0 green, 1 red, 2 cannot run.
  review [BASE] [CARD]      another model reviews the diff, read-only. Exit 0 PASS, 1 CHANGES,
                            2 no model answered (the task is not reviewed).
  baseline                  ratchet mode: record today's CRAP debt; only new debt is red
  doctor                    check the tools and the configuration, list what is left to do
  uml [open|install|metrics|ir]                  uml-viewer: modules, dependencies, Dependency Rule
  tools [install|crapper|mutator|dryer ARGS...]  Martin's tools at pinned commits

Settings: .ub/config. Logs: .ub/out/. Needs git and Python >= 3.9; the tools need >= 3.11.
GATE_SKIP=verify,crap,dry,mutation,structure skips gate stages (the reviewer sees it).
"""
